        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="download-card reveal">
        <div class="pill">Framework</div>

        <div class="download-title">
          Capability Development Framework
        </div>

        <div class="download-desc">
          Structured institutional capability development methodology.
        </div>

        <a class="arm-link" href="#">
          Coming Soon →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="download-card reveal">
        <div class="pill">Catalogue</div>

        <div class="download-title">
          Learning Catalogue
        </div>

        <div class="download-desc">
          Complete programme catalogue for institutional teams.
        </div>

        <a class="arm-link" href="#">
          Coming Soon →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" style="background: var(--cream)">
  <div class="section-inner">

    <div class="section-tag reveal">
      Implementation Resources
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-heading reveal">
      RMS Implementation <em>Toolkit</em>
    </h2>

    <p class="section-sub reveal">
      Resources supporting operational strengthening, governance
      implementation, portfolio improvement, and institutional execution.
    </p>

    <div class="download-grid">

      <div class="download-card reveal">
        <div class="pill">ICAR</div>

        <div class="download-title">
          ICAR Framework
        </div>

        <div class="download-desc">
          Institutional Capability Assessment & Review methodology.
        </div>

        <a class="arm-link" href="#">
