        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="download-card reveal">
        <div class="pill">RMS</div>

        <div class="download-title">
          RMS Implementation Brochure
        </div>

        <div class="download-desc">
          Operational strengthening and institutional implementation support.
        </div>

        <a class="arm-link" href="#">
          Coming Soon →
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" style="background: var(--white); padding-bottom:110px;">
  <div class="section-inner">

    <div class="section-tag reveal">
      Research & Publications
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-heading reveal">
      Knowledge & Institutional <em>Research</em>
    </h2>

    <p class="section-sub reveal">
      Publications, research papers, institutional case studies,
      governance insights, and thought leadership from the KIPROD ecosystem.
    </p>

    <div class="download-grid">

      <div class="download-card reveal">
        <div class="pill">Research</div>

        <div class="download-title">
          White Papers
        </div>

        <div class="download-desc">
          In-depth research on governance, risk and institutional performance.
        </div>

        <a class="arm-link" href="/insights">
          View Publications →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="download-card reveal">
        <div class="pill">Insights</div>

        <div class="download-title">
          Executive Insights Collection
        </div>

        <div class="download-desc">
          Executive articles, governance perspectives and institutional intelligence.
        </div>

        <a class="arm-link" href="/insights">
          Explore Insights →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="download-card reveal">
        <div class="pill">Case Studies</div>

