<section class="institutional stats-section">

  <div class="section-inner">

    <div class="section-tag reveal">
      KIPROD Impact
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-heading reveal">
      Building stronger institutions through
      <em>knowledge, capability and execution</em>
    </h2>

    <p class="section-sub reveal">
      Our work focuses on strengthening governance, improving institutional
      capability and supporting sustainable performance across financial
      institutions.
    </p>

    <div class="stats-grid">

  <div class="stat-card reveal">
    <div class="stat-icon">🏛️</div>

    <div class="stat-title">
      Institutional Partnerships
    </div>

    <p class="stat-desc">
      Collaborating with banks, SACCOs, microfinance institutions,
      regulators and development partners.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="stat-card reveal">
    <div class="stat-icon">🎓</div>

    <div class="stat-title">
      Executive Capability Development
    </div>

    <p class="stat-desc">
      Professional learning, executive education and institutional
      capability strengthening programmes.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="stat-card reveal">
    <div class="stat-icon">📊</div>

    <div class="stat-title">
      Governance & Risk Advisory
    </div>

    <p class="stat-desc">
      Supporting governance excellence, portfolio quality,
      operational performance and sustainable growth.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="stat-card reveal">
    <div class="stat-icon">⚙️</div>

    <div class="stat-title">
      Seven-Stage Institutional Framework
    </div>

    <p class="stat-desc">
      A structured methodology guiding institutions from assessment
      through implementation and continuous improvement.
    </p>
  </div>

</div>

</section>
